#: party.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<div align=\"center\"><b>Party Mode</b></div>"
"<br>"
"<p>"
"Party mode is a complex playlist handling mechanism - acting basically on "
"the concept of a 'rotating' playlist.  The playlist can be modelled as a "
"queuing system, FIFO.  As a track is advanced, the first track in the "
"playlist is removed, and another appended to the end.  The type of addition "
"is selected by the user during configuration.</p>"
msgstr ""

